# lf001, the long stairs (doc 84 §9.7): the luna table of rm_berit_kelpwick, ported. Her accent is gone (none): the
# Larkfield in her words only through symbols. Her stall is the realm's, not the Heights' egg stall the table said.
mantle lf001
state ready
dialect larkfield
accent none light
tier standard
written_for rm_berit_kelpwick
title the long stairs
fits stage=adult|old
prefers role=merchant
traits talk=quiet humour=dry warmth=warm
quirk takes_the_long_stairs_two_at_a_time
likes clean_fur
dislikes muddy_lanes
fears falling_back
hopes the_heights
topics work +.2 prices +.2
styles tease=dry refuse=soft
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# keeps a stall in the Commons: quiet, dry and warm under it, born low and climbing, taking the long stairs two at a time.

words
saying! = A full-weight egg makes a fair bargain | Clean shell, clean trade
oath! = By the cold shine | Wind and weather
farewell = Fair price on your way
agree = Done, then
surprise = Well, now | There's a thing

rule @stall
when concept=bark working=yes self.role=merchant
does aside
cooldown 6h
say Fair prices, full weight, fresh this morning. | Step up; I don't bite before noon.

rule @stairs
when concept=bark working=no
does aside
cooldown 8h
say The long stairs are quicker two at a time. | Leave the cleanest one aside. Tomorrow deserves a proper breakfast.

scene remark
when concept=talk.smalltalk
does tell.self / react.self
a : A comfortable wolf can still tell a light weight from a full one. That's something.
b : It is. Plenty can't.

line greet.return : #greet#. Mind the stairs; they bite harder going down.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line react.news.new : #surprise#! Who told you that?
line react.news.known : So I'd heard. Doesn't make it better.
line answer.how [self.working=yes] : Busy, and glad of it.
line answer.how : Well enough. Can't grumble.

dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #greet#, #topic.player#. Come for goods, or for news?
